            Who We Are
          </div>


          <h3>
            Standing with people as they rebuild their lives.
          </h3>


          <p>

            Compassion Initiative, South Sudan is an indigenous South Sudanese
            organisation committed to raising hope among vulnerable people,
            restoring dignity and empowering communities to build better and
            more sustainable lives.

          </p>


          <p>

            We understand the realities faced by communities affected by
            poverty, conflict, displacement, hunger, disasters and limited
            economic opportunities.

          </p>


          <p>

            Our work seeks not only to respond to immediate needs, but also to
            help people rebuild livelihoods, strengthen resilience and become
            active participants in shaping their own future.

          </p>


          <div class="quote-box">

            <p>

              “We do not see vulnerable people simply as recipients of
              assistance. We see individuals with gifts, knowledge, abilities
              and potential.”

            </p>

          </div>


        </div>



