        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            01
          </div>


          <h3>
            Women's Empowerment
          </h3>


          <p>

            We support vulnerable women, particularly widows and women affected
            by poverty, conflict and displacement, to strengthen their economic
            independence and participation in community life.

          </p>


        </article>



        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            02
          </div>


          <h3>
            Savings & Micro-Loans
          </h3>


          <p>

            We organise women into savings groups and support access to small
            loans and resources that can help members begin or strengthen
            income-generating activities.

          </p>


        </article>



        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            03
          </div>


          <h3>
            Skills & Entrepreneurship
          </h3>


          <p>

            We provide practical support in financial management, savings,
            entrepreneurship, small business development and community
            leadership.

          </p>


        </article>



        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            04
          </div>


          <h3>
            Community Development
          </h3>


          <p>

            We work with communities to identify local priorities, strengthen
            resilience and develop practical solutions that respond to their
            needs and aspirations.

          </p>


        </article>



        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            05
          </div>


          <h3>
            Education Support
          </h3>


          <p>

            We support vulnerable children through learning materials, teacher
            support, temporary learning spaces and mobilisation of resources
            for simple classrooms.

          </p>


        </article>



        <article class="program-card">


          <div class="program-number">
            06
          </div>


          <h3>
            Humanitarian Response
          </h3>


          <p>

            We stand alongside communities affected by disasters, displacement,
            hunger and other emergencies through appropriate humanitarian and
            relief support.

          </p>


        </article>


      </div>


    </section>



